          "en": "\"The first to come to us were Mus'ab ibn 'Umayr and Ibn Umm Maktum, and they taught people the Qur'an. Then Bilal, Sa'd and 'Ammar ibn Yasir came, then 'Umar ibn al-Khattab with twenty of the Companions of the Prophet ﷺ, then the Prophet ﷺ came. I never saw the people of Madinah rejoice at anything as they rejoiced at the Messenger of Allah ﷺ, until the slave girls were saying: The Messenger of Allah ﷺ has come! And before he came I had already learned ﴿Glorify the name of your Lord, the Most High﴾ among other surahs of the Mufassal.\""
